@baseUrl = https://localhost:7001

### ============================================
### CANCEL DELEGATE ENDPOINTS
### ============================================

### Cancel Delegate - Valid Request
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Delegation/CancelDelegate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "delegateID": "b5eec2e4-ec4d-f111-bec6-70a8a5695569",
  "cancelledOn": "2026-05-12"
}

###

### Cancel Delegate - With Current Date
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Delegation/CancelDelegate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "delegateID": "a1b2c3d4-e5f6-4a5b-8c9d-0e1f2a3b4c5d",
  "cancelledOn": "2025-01-15"
}

###

### Cancel Delegate - Invalid GUID (400 Bad Request)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Delegation/CancelDelegate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "delegateID": "invalid-guid",
  "cancelledOn": "2026-05-12"
}

###

### Cancel Delegate - Missing DelegateID (400 Bad Request)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Delegation/CancelDelegate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cancelledOn": "2026-05-12"
}

###

### Cancel Delegate - Invalid Date Format (400 Bad Request)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Delegation/CancelDelegate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "delegateID": "b5eec2e4-ec4d-f111-bec6-70a8a5695569",
  "cancelledOn": "invalid-date"
}

###

### Cancel Delegate - Non-existent Delegate (404 Not Found)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Delegation/CancelDelegate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "delegateID": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "cancelledOn": "2026-05-12"
}

