POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Delegation/GetDelegateList
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "delegationStatus": true
}

###

### Get Delegate List - Empty EmailId (400 Bad Request)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Delegation/GetDelegateList
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "emailId": "",
  "delegationStatus": true
}

